<title>CHINA: Standard Life opens Shanghai office.</title>
<headline>Standard Life opens Shanghai office.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British insurance company Standard Life said in a statement on Tuesday that is has opened a representative office in Shanghai.</p>
<p>Shanghai was the headquarters of the company's Far East operations from 1900 to 1937, the statement said.</p>
<p>The company was set up in Britain in 1825 and has extended its operations to many parts of the world including Canada, India and Latin America, the statement said but gave no more details.</p>
</text>
